<title>LEBANON: SOCCER-LEBANON AND ALGERIA DRAW 2-2 IN FRIENDLY.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-LEBANON AND ALGERIA DRAW 2-2 IN FRIENDLY.</headline>
<dateline>BEIRUT 1997-01-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lebanon and Algeria drew 2-2</p>
<p>(halftime 0-1) in a friendly soccer international on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Lebanon - Wartan Ghazarian (73), Wael Nazha (81)</p>
<p>Algeria - Khaled Lonissi (45 pen), Abdelhafiz</p>
<p>Tisfawt (88)</p>
<p>Attendance: 12,000.</p>
</text>
